986 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 210 0 R
/T (1. First Normal Form \(1NF\) Compliance: Multi-valued attributes were eliminated. In unnormalized prescription records, multiple medications were listed as repeating groups. These were decomposed into the atomic entity prescription_items. Furthermore, all non-atomic attributes \(e.g., full names\) were decomposed into distinct atomic columns)
/E (1. First Normal Form \(1NF\) Compliance: Multi-valued attributes were eliminated. In unnormalized prescription records, multiple medications were listed as repeating groups. These were decomposed into the atomic entity prescription_items. Furthermore, all non-atomic attributes \(e.g., full names\) were decomposed into distinct atomic columns)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
