1369 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 217 0 R
/T (This chapter demonstrates how the final Python application prototype interacts directly with the normalized database design through persistent connectivity, RESTful API routing, transaction management, defensive exception handling, analytical reporting views, and comprehensive positive/negative test execution.)
/E (This chapter demonstrates how the final Python application prototype interacts directly with the normalized database design through persistent connectivity, RESTful API routing, transaction management, defensive exception handling, analytical reporting views, and comprehensive positive/negative test execution.)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
1370 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 217 0 R
/T (The developed software application, CarePulse Hospital Management System, is engineered as a zero-dependency, self-contained Python application \(app.py\). It exposes both a responsive, modern HTML5/CSS3 Web Graphical Dashboard and an interactive Command-Line Interface \(CLI\). The web client communicates with the Python backend controller over lightweight HTTP RESTful JSON endpoints, providing hospital staff with real-time tools for patient registration, doctor schedule lookup, conflict-free appointment scheduling, clinical consultation recording, interactive bed occupancy visualization, invoice settlement, and direct SQL sandbox querying. The application interacts directly with the underlying SQLite database engine, ensuring that all database-level foreign key cascades, check constraints, and triggers actively safeguard every transaction.)
/E (The developed software application, CarePulse Hospital Management System, is engineered as a zero-dependency, self-contained Python application \(app.py\). It exposes both a responsive, modern HTML5/CSS3 Web Graphical Dashboard and an interactive Command-Line Interface \(CLI\). The web client communicates with the Python backend controller over lightweight HTTP RESTful JSON endpoints, providing hospital staff with real-time tools for patient registration, doctor schedule lookup, conflict-free appointment scheduling, clinical consultation recording, interactive bed occupancy visualization, invoice settlement, and direct SQL sandbox querying. The application interacts directly with the underlying SQLite database engine, ensuring that all database-level foreign key cascades, check constraints, and triggers actively safeguard every transaction.)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
