1779 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 227 0 R
/T (All seven critical test cases executed successfully with a 100% pass rate. The testing verification confirms that the application controller correctly delegates data integrity enforcement to the relational database engine. Declarative constraints and procedural triggers reliably reject overlapping doctor consultations and concurrent bed assignments, while automated triggers maintain perfect mathematical synchronization between financial payment records and parent invoice balances.)
/E (All seven critical test cases executed successfully with a 100% pass rate. The testing verification confirms that the application controller correctly delegates data integrity enforcement to the relational database engine. Declarative constraints and procedural triggers reliably reject overlapping doctor consultations and concurrent bed assignments, while automated triggers maintain perfect mathematical synchronization between financial payment records and parent invoice balances.)
/Pg 46 0 R
/K [38]
>>
endobj
